#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:1
msgid ""
"Port of the OpenBSD `bcrypt_pbkdf` function to pure Javascript. "
"`npm`-ified version of [Devi Mandiri's "
"port](https://github.com/devi/tmp/blob/master/js/bcrypt_pbkdf.js), with "
"some minor performance improvements. The code is copied verbatim (and un-"
"styled) from Devi's work."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:6
msgid "This product includes software developed by Niels Provos."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:8
msgid "API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:10
msgid "`bcrypt_pbkdf.pbkdf(pass, passlen, salt, saltlen, key, keylen, rounds)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:12
msgid ""
"Derive a cryptographic key of arbitrary length from a given password and "
"salt, using the OpenBSD `bcrypt_pbkdf` function. This is a combination of"
" Blowfish and SHA-512."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:16
msgid ""
"See [this article](http://www.tedunangst.com/flak/post/bcrypt-pbkdf) for "
"further information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:19
#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:34
msgid "Parameters:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:21
msgid "`pass`, a Uint8Array of length `passlen`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:22
msgid "`passlen`, an integer Number"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:23
msgid "`salt`, a Uint8Array of length `saltlen`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:24
msgid "`saltlen`, an integer Number"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:25
msgid "`key`, a Uint8Array of length `keylen`, will be filled with output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:26
msgid "`keylen`, an integer Number"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:27
msgid "`rounds`, an integer Number, number of rounds of the PBKDF to run"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:29
msgid "`bcrypt_pbkdf.hash(sha2pass, sha2salt, out)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:31
msgid ""
"Calculate a Blowfish hash, given SHA2-512 output of a password and salt. "
"Used as part of the inner round function in the PBKDF."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:36
msgid "`sha2pass`, a Uint8Array of length 64"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:37
msgid "`sha2salt`, a Uint8Array of length 64"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/bcrypt-pbkdf_README.md:38
msgid "`out`, a Uint8Array of length 32, will be filled with output"
msgstr ""

